<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - H.F. Ahmanson removed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - H.F. Ahmanson removed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz said on Thursday it removed H.F. Ahmanson &amp; Co from its recommended list of stocks because the shares had reached their $45 price target.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Leslie Nelkin said in a research note the stock had been a strong performer in recent weeks, following H.F. Ahmanson's announcement it would withdraw its bid for Great Western Financial Corp. It was now fairly valued.</p>
<p>-- Ahmanson's stock was up 1/2 at 45-1/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
